<th class="num">%</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td class="winner">Asha Mollel <span class="badge">Winner</span></td>
<td class="num">1,575</td><td class="num">50.0</td></tr>
<tr><td class="">Juma &lt;Ali&gt; <span class="muted small">Timu &amp; Wenzake</span></td>
<td class="num">1,575</td><td class="num">50.0</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<div class="notes">Eligible: 5,000 · Voted: 3,200 · Skipped: 50<br>Quorum 50.0%: met<br>Tie resolved by Neema Mushi (20 Nov 2026, 16:30): Kura ya bahati mbele ya wagombea wote</div>
</section>
<section class="category">
<h2>Katiba mpya <span class="muted small">1 seat</span></h2>
